From 04a6d73630770befb29e3fe6171375c55422d7c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mbadusha <mbadusha@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 09:32:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [Description] : Adds WANStats objects under Hosts.Host.{i} and XHosts.XHost.{i} with BytesSent and BytesReceived counters.
Implements LM-lite backend aggregation logic and DML/plugin registrations to expose per-client WAN traffic statistics.
[RCA/Root Cause Analysis]:
Per-client WAN byte counters were not available in LM-lite data model, so host-level packet statistics were missing.
Stats collection needed unified handling across tracked IPv4/IPv6 client entries and runtime host-table lookups.

Signed-off-by: mbadusha <mbadusha@qti.qualcomm.com>
